        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Social Distancing Infographic</title>\n<style>\n  * {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #1a1a4e;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  /* Header */\n  .header {\n    background-color: #1a1a4e;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 30px 20px 25px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .header-arrow {\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 4px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to right,\n      #f5a623 0px,\n      #f5a623 8px,\n      transparent 8px,\n      transparent 14px\n    );\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .header-arrow.left::after {\n    content: '◀';\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -5px;\n    top: -10px;\n    color: #f5a623;\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .header-arrow.right::after {\n    content: '▶';\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -5px;\n    top: -10px;\n    color: #f5a623;\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .header h1 {\n    font-size: 52px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .header h1 .script {\n    font-family: 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-size: 56px;\n  }\n\n  .header h1 .bold {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    font-size: 48px;\n  }\n\n  /* Main two-column section */\n  .main-content {\n    display: flex;\n    min-height: 500px;\n  }\n\n  .left-column {\n    flex: 1;\n    background-color: #1a1a4e;\n    padding: 40px 35px;\n  }\n\n  .right-column {\n    flex: 1;\n    background-color: #1e5a8a;\n    padding: 40px 35px;\n  }\n\n  /* Icon circles */\n  .icon-circle {\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 70px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: #f5a623;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .icon-circle.small {\n    width: 55px;\n    height: 55px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .section-title {\n    color: #f5a623;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  .section-text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #e0e0e0;\n  }\n\n  .section-text strong {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .left-section {\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n\n  /* Right column best practices */\n  .best-practices-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .best-practices-header .icon-circle {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .best-practices-header h2 {\n    color: #f5a623;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  .practice-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n  }\n\n  .practice-icon {\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: #1a4a7a;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    font-size: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .practice-text {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #e0e0e0;\n  }\n\n  .practice-text strong {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  /* Bottom section */\n  .bottom-section {\n    background-color: #1a1a4e;\n    padding: 40px 35px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-section .icon-circle {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-content h2 {\n    color: #f5a623;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-content p {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #e0e0e0;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-content p strong {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  /* Footer */\n  .footer {\n    background-color: #151540;\n    padding: 25px 35px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n  }\n\n  .footer-source h4 {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  .footer-source a {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #a0a0c0;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    margin-bottom: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-source a:hover {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n\n  .footer-logo {\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n\n  .footer-logo .made-with {\n    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-logo .visme {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .visme-logo-icon {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 20px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4fc3f7, #f5a623, #e91e63);\n    border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .visme-logo-icon::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: -3px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n\n  /* SVG icon placeholders */\n  .svg-icon {\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n  }\n\n  .svg-icon-sm {\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 24px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .main-content {\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .header h1 {\n      font-size: 32px;\n    }\n    .header h1 .script {\n      font-size: 36px;\n    }\n    .header h1 .bold {\n      font-size: 30px;\n    }\n    .bottom-section {\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 15px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- Header -->\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"header-arrow left\"></div>\n  <h1><span class=\"script\">Social</span> <span class=\"bold\">DISTANCING</span></h1>\n  <div class=\"header-arrow right\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Main Two-Column Content -->\n<div class=\"main-content\">\n\n  <!-- Left Column -->\n  <div class=\"left-column\">\n\n    <!-- What is Social Distancing -->\n    <div class=\"left-section\">\n      <div class=\"icon-circle\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n          <line x1=\"4\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"12\"/>\n          <polyline points=\"8,8 4,12 8,16\"/>\n          <polyline points=\"16,8 20,12 16,16\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">What is Social<br>Distancing?</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-text\">\n        Social distancing, also called physical distancing, is a form of <strong>non-pharmaceutical intervention</strong>, which downtrends the spread of contagious diseases simply by <strong>keeping people \"apart\" from each other.</strong>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Why is Social Distancing Important -->\n    <div class=\"left-section\">\n      <div class=\"icon-circle\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"16\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Why is Social<br>Distancing Important?</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-text\">\n        It <strong>prevents contact between infected and uninfected individuals</strong>, resulting in reduced disease transmission and less deaths from fatal diseases.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right Column -->\n  <div class=\"right-column\">\n\n    <!-- Best Practices Header -->\n    <div class=\"best-practices-header\">\n      <div class=\"icon-circle\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n          <polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h2>Best Practices for<br>Social Distancing</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Practice 1 -->\n    <div class=\"practice-item\">\n      <div class=\"practice-icon\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n          <path d=\"M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-4 0a1 1 0 01-1-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 01-1 1\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"practice-text\">\n        <strong>Self/Home Quarantine: Stay home.</strong> Only go out if it's very essential, that too with protection (gloves, masks, sanitizers)\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Practice 2 -->\n    <div class=\"practice-item\">\n      <div class=\"practice-icon\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n          <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"3\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"7\" r=\"3\"/>\n          <path d=\"M3 21v-2a4 4 0 014-4h4a4 4 0 014 4v2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M17 11a4 4 0 014 4v2\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"practice-text\">\n        <strong>Avoid public gatherings</strong> as much as possible\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Practice 3 -->\n    <div class=\"practice-item\">\n      <div class=\"practice-icon\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n          <rect x=\"3\" y=\"7\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1\"/>\n          <path d=\"M3 11h18\"/>\n          <path d=\"M7 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"practice-text\">\n        Keep spots susceptible to mass gatherings like <strong>parks, malls, food courts, restaurants and schools closed.</strong> Restaurants can be instructed to follow a \"Takeaway\" only system until the situation relaxes\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Practice 4 -->\n    <div class=\"practice-item\">\n      <div class=\"practice-icon\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n          <rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"14\"/>\n          <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"14\"/>\n          <line x1=\"14\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"14\"/>\n          <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"14\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"practice-text\">\n        Maintain a distance of <strong>at least 1 - 2 meters (3 to 6 feet) from other individuals</strong>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Practice 5 -->\n    <div class=\"practice-item\">\n      <div class=\"practice-icon\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-icon-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n          <path d=\"M7 11l5 5 5-5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M4 7l3 3 3-3\"/>\n          <path d=\"M14 7l3 3 3-3\"/>\n          <path d=\"M7 11V7\"/>\n          <path d=\"M17 11V7\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"practice-text\">\n        <strong>Avoid shaking hands</strong> and embracing one another\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Bottom Section -->\n<div class=\"bottom-section\">\n  <div class=\"icon-circle\">\n    <svg class=\"svg-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n      <polyline points=\"22,12 18,12 15,21 9,3 6,12 2,12\"/>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bottom-content\">\n    <h2>Social Distancing in the Time<br>of COVID-19: Flattening the Curve</h2>\n    <p>\n      For a disease like COVID-19, which spreads through air droplets from sneezing and coughing, scientists have claimed that <strong>social distancing might \"flatten the curve\".</strong>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      This means that if proper social distancing protocols are followed, the spread of the disease will <strong>slow down and relieve health care professionals and medical centers</strong> of the burden of providing aid to hundreds of patients at a time, which is not feasible.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<div class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"footer-source\">\n    <h4>Source:</h4>\n    <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_distancing\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_distancing</a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public\">https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public</a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.vox.com/2020/3/15/21179296/coronavirus-covid-19-social-distancing-bored-pandemic-quarantine-ethics\">https://www.vox.com/2020/3/15/21179296/coronavirus-covid-19-social-distancing-bored-pandemic-quarantine-ethics</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"footer-logo\">\n    <div class=\"made-with\">Made with</div>\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"visme-logo-icon\"></span>\n      <span class=\"visme\">visme</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
